{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fisheye</strong> is a cute and relaxing <strong>photography game</strong>. Take a deep breath and dive to snap pics of marine wildlife in their natural habitat with your ROV!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463530/extras/Gif_Biomes_Vertical.gif?t=1743788146\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this underwater photo safari, your goal is to <strong>explore</strong> the region, fill your database with fish pics, and document their behaviors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and observe your surroundings to catch a hammerhead shark hunting, a mama whale nursing its calf, or a clownfish snuggling in the protection of an anemone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Snap neat shots and <strong>collect</strong> all your findings in your database!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463530/extras/Gif_PhotoMode_Vertical.gif?t=1743788146\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Snap</strong> striking shots and <strong>discover all</strong> the fish's natural behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect</strong> wildlife snapshots and information in your database</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore</strong> colorful voxel environments. Marvel at a thriving coral reef, glide through a towering kelp forest, uncover the hidden wonders of a crystal cave, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Light <strong>upgrade</strong> system to explore farther and improve your ROV</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cute fishes</strong>. (Leviathans not included. We\u2019re not trying to trigger your thalassophobia. You\u2019re welcome.)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3463530?t=1743788146","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3463530?t=1743788146","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463530/633a3001645fc2e7d7c5ca7ee4a65515d1fe1c27/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743788146","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463530/633a3001645fc2e7d7c5ca7ee4a65515d1fe1c27/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743788146","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fisheye</strong> is a cute and relaxing <strong>photography game</strong>. Take a deep breath and dive to snap pics of marine wildlife in their natural habitat with your ROV!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463530/extras/Gif_Biomes_Vertical.gif?t=1743788146\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this underwater photo safari, your goal is to <strong>explore</strong> the region, fill your database with fish pics, and document their behaviors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and observe your surroundings to catch a hammerhead shark hunting, a mama whale nursing its calf, or a clownfish snuggling in the protection of an anemone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Snap neat shots and <strong>collect</strong> all your findings in your database!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463530/extras/Gif_PhotoMode_Vertical.gi